Now let me write the test. I'll model tests on the team skill's two pitfalls:

Test 1: non-empty resource returns exact bytes and hits files/download.
```js
test("fetches from files/download and returns the bytes verbatim", async () => {
  const bytes = Buffer.from("#!/bin/sh\necho hi\n");
  let seen;
  const fetcher = async (url, opts) => {
    seen = { url, opts };
