Test 6: default fetcher — optional. I'll add one that swaps globalThis.fetch to assert default path used. Careful: `globalThis.fetch` captured inside function at call time. We can set `globalThis.fetch = stub` then restore. Use try/finally. This tests requirement "缺省用 globalThis.fetch". Good and cheap.
